' QUESTION THIS DIAGRAM ANSWERS: How do payments take different substantiation routes before settlement?
' SOURCES: Generic abstraction [RA12009] [GAM] [NBC599]
@startuml
title 07j Alternative disbursement control gates
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Determine expenditure, legal authority, fund, payment route;
if (Payment type?) then (contract)
  :Verify contract and obligation;
  if (Evidence?) then (completed delivery)
    :Inspect and accept delivery;
  else (advance or progress)
    :Apply case-specific advance or progress billing controls;
  endif
elseif (payroll)
  :Validate position, entitlement and payroll;
elseif (transfer)
  :Validate recipient, transfer conditions and legal basis;
elseif (debt)
  :Validate due amounts, schedules and debt authority;
else (other)
  :Validate applicable documentary and legal conditions;
endif
:Validate claim, cash authority or alternative valid channel;
if (All controls met?) then (yes)
  :Issue payment and obtain bank evidence;
  :Record, reconcile and retain audit trail;
else (no)
  :Hold, reject or cure exception;
endif
stop
@enduml
